e have $n=1$ and $\\lambda =1.$ since $n=1,$ we don't need any derivatives. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f({J}_{1}(3)) & =[\\begin{aligned}f(3)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{3}^{4}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}81\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({J}_{3}(2)\\,⊕\\,{J}_{1}(3))}^{4} & ={({J}_{3}(2))}^{4}\\,⊕\\,{({J}_{1}(3))}^{4} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}16 & 32 & 24 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 16 & 32 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 16 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 81\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377882 1000 #edb/ref 17592186377883 13194139535978 true] [17592186377882 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535978 true] [17592186377882 1041 "field-1" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377882 1104 #edb/ref 17592186377883 13194139535978 true] [17592186377882 1110 #uuid "b0e5a2cc-0dc2-5ed6-b30e-6469780d2de9" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377883 1034 "16" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377883 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535978 true] [17592186377883 1111 #uuid "924d4dc6-9636-5495-8beb-c36fcf1926ff" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186377885 13194139535978 true] [17592186377884 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535978 true] [17592186377884 1041 "field-2" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377884 1104 #edb/ref 17592186377885 13194139535978 true] [17592186377884 1110 #uuid "d46816a9-b2b5-582a-ae0e-4274b607f241" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377885 1034 "32" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377885 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535978 true] [17592186377885 1111 #uuid "54b6728e-4ca7-5a85-8054-380091ef3456" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186377887 13194139535978 true] [17592186377886 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535978 true] [17592186377886 1041 "field-3" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377886 1104 #edb/ref 17592186377887 13194139535978 true] [17592186377886 1110 #uuid "0eb96a9a-481e-5bf5-adeb-2e25370a1c2f" 13194139535978 true] [17592186377887 